{"seq":1,"slug":"payout-rate-cost-model","title":"赔付率与保障成本模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/consumer-guarantee-promise-platform/guarantee-cost-ops/payout-rate-cost-model","wordCount":2099,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"赔付率与保障成本模型\">赔付率与保障成本模型</h1><p>保障成本模型要回答的是一个看似简单、实际上口径极易被操纵的问题：<strong>这个保障产品一单要花平台多少钱？</strong> 口径定义不清的后果是灾难性的——一个把现金赔付和补偿券混在一起统计的报表，会让决策者以为成本很低而继续扩大承诺；一个把追偿回收额忽略掉的报表，会让决策者以为成本很高而错误收缩产品。因此本篇的重点不是公式，而是<strong>口径</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-赔付率的三种定义\">核心概念：赔付率的三种定义</h2><p>「赔付率」这个词在三个不同的圈子里含义不同，混用会得出相反的结论。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>保险型赔付率</td>\n<td>赔付总额 ÷ 保费收入</td>\n<td>运费险等有保费的产品</td>\n<td>价保无保费，分母为零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台型赔付率</td>\n<td>赔付总额 ÷ 该保障覆盖的 GMV</td>\n<td>免费赠送类保障</td>\n<td>GMV 口径（含税/不含税）影响结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位经济型</td>\n<td>赔付总额 ÷ 覆盖订单数</td>\n<td>跨产品横向比较</td>\n<td>忽略订单金额差异</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三个定义都有用，但不能混着看。<strong>运费险必须用保险型</strong>，因为它有保费收入，用 GMV 做分母会掩盖产品的真实盈利性；<strong>免费赠送的保障必须用平台型或单位经济型</strong>，因为它们没有保费收入，分母为零的公式无法计算。价保是特殊的——它没有保费收入，因此在财务上不是保险而是营销支出，应该用单位经济型并放进获客成本口径核算，而不是与保险产品放在同一张表里比赔付率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本的完整构成\">成本的完整构成</h2><p>赔付金额只是成本的一部分。完整的产品成本至少包含五项，漏掉任何一项都会低估真实成本。行业数据可以说明这个量级：零售业退货总额预计达到 <strong>8900 亿美元</strong>，而 <strong>93% 的零售商认为零售欺诈与其他侵蚀性行为是显著问题</strong>（<a href=\"https://nrf.com/research/2024-consumer-returns-retail-industry\">NRF 2024 Consumer Returns in the Retail Industry</a>）——退货与欺诈成本正是保障成本模型里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fraud</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fraud}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fraud</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 那一项的现实来源。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>unit</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>payout</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>recovery</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>ops</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fraud</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>reserve</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>covered</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{unit}} = \\frac{E[\\text{payout}] - E[\\text{recovery}] + C_{\\text{ops}} + C_{\\text{fraud}} + C_{\\text{reserve}}}{N_{\\text{covered}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.263em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">covered</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payout</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">recovery</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ops</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fraud</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reserve</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>payout</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{payout}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payout</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是期望赔付额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>recovery</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{recovery}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">recovery</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是期望追偿回收额（<strong>这一项常被漏掉</strong>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>ops</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{ops}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ops</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是分摊的运营成本（人工复核、客服工单），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fraud</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fraud}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fraud</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是因滥用而多付的部分，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>reserve</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{reserve}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reserve</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是准备金的资金占用成本（第二章的资金池规模乘以资金成本率），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>covered</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{covered}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">covered</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是被该保障覆盖的订单数。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  G[覆盖订单数 N] --&gt; C[单位成本 C_unit]&#10;  P[赔付总额] --&gt; C&#10;  R[追偿回收] -.-&gt;|扣减| C&#10;  O[运营成本] --&gt; C&#10;  F[欺诈损失] --&gt; C&#10;  V[准备金占用] --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; D{是否低于阈值?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| K[维持或扩大承诺]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| S[收缩承诺范围]&#10;  S --&gt; G2[重新设计产品: 窗口/上限/品类]\">graph TD\n  G[覆盖订单数 N] --&gt; C[单位成本 C_unit]\n  P[赔付总额] --&gt; C\n  R[追偿回收] -.-&gt;|扣减| C\n  O[运营成本] --&gt; C\n  F[欺诈损失] --&gt; C\n  V[准备金占用] --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; D{是否低于阈值?}\n  D --&gt;|是| K[维持或扩大承诺]\n  D --&gt;|否| S[收缩承诺范围]\n  S --&gt; G2[重新设计产品: 窗口/上限/品类]</pre><p>这张图右侧的反馈箭头就是本 hub 的闭环：单位成本超标时，动作是收缩产品，而不是简单地要求风控「少赔一点」。后者会伤害体验且往往无效，前者才是可持续的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"追偿回收额为什么必须扣减\">追偿回收额为什么必须扣减</h3><p>一个真实的管理场景：某类赔付的毛赔付额很高，若不扣减追偿，产品会显示为巨大亏损，决策者可能直接砍掉它；但如果追偿回收率其实有 70%，这个产品可能是健康的。反过来，如果只看净额而不知道追偿依赖卖家余额这个前提，一旦卖家大规模结算离场，净额会突然恶化而没有任何预警。因此正确的做法是<strong>同时报告毛额、回收额与回收率</strong>，并把回收率作为独立监控指标。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>监控价值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>毛赔付额</td>\n<td>全部赔付支出</td>\n<td>与预算比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>追偿回收额</td>\n<td>实际收回的金额</td>\n<td>与应收回比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回收率</td>\n<td>回收额 ÷ 应回收额</td>\n<td>下降预示卖家离场风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>净赔付额</td>\n<td>毛额 − 回收额</td>\n<td>真实成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"期望赔付额的计算\">期望赔付额的计算</h2><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>payout</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{payout}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payout</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是模型的核心，它的计算方式是<strong>违约概率 × 单笔赔付额</strong>的期望。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>payout</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>breach</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>payout</mtext><mo>∣</mo><msub><mtext>breach</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{payout}] = \\sum_{k} P(\\text{breach}_k) \\cdot \\mathbb{E}[\\text{payout} \\mid \\text{breach}_k]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payout</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">breach</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payout</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">breach</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 遍历所有违约类型（延迟、未达、货不对板、反悔退货等）。这个分解的价值在于它让每一类违约可以被独立监控与独立优化。运营中常见的情况是总体赔付率平稳，但某一类的概率在上升而另一类在下降，两者抵消——只看总量的报表会完全错过这个信号。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 按违约类型分解赔付率（月度）&#10;WITH cov AS (&#10;  SELECT guarantee_id, date_trunc(&#39;month&#39;, covered_at) AS m, count(*) AS n_covered&#10;  FROM   guarantee_coverage GROUP BY 1, 2&#10;), pay AS (&#10;  SELECT c.guarantee_id, s.breach_type, date_trunc(&#39;month&#39;, o.executed_at) AS m,&#10;         sum(o.amount) AS payout, sum(o.recovered_amount) AS recovery&#10;  FROM   compensation_order o&#10;  JOIN   breach_signal s USING (signal_id)&#10;  JOIN   guarantee_coverage c USING (order_line_id)&#10;  WHERE  o.state = &#39;executed&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY 1, 2, 3&#10;)&#10;SELECT p.guarantee_id, p.m, p.breach_type,&#10;       p.payout / NULLIF(c.n_covered, 0)             AS payout_per_covered,&#10;       (p.payout - p.recovery) / NULLIF(c.n_covered, 0) AS net_cost_per_covered,&#10;       p.recovery / NULLIF(p.payout, 0)              AS recovery_ratio&#10;FROM   pay p JOIN cov c ON c.guarantee_id = p.guarantee_id AND c.m = p.m;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按违约类型分解赔付率（月度）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cov </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> guarantee_id, date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'month'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, covered_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_covered</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   guarantee_coverage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), pay </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">guarantee_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">breach_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'month'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">executed_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payout, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">recovered_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> recovery</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   compensation_order o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   breach_signal s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (signal_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   guarantee_coverage c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_line_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'executed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">guarantee_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">breach_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">payout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n_covered</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payout_per_covered,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">payout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">recovery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n_covered</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_cost_per_covered,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">recovery</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">payout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recovery_ratio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   pay p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cov c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">guarantee_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">guarantee_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>用 <code>payout_per_covered</code>（每覆盖订单的赔付额）而不是百分比，是因为它在不同保障产品之间可比——各产品的「覆盖订单数」定义一致，而 GMV 口径在不同产品间不可比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单位经济阈值怎么定\">单位经济阈值怎么定</h2><p>算出了单位成本，还需要一个阈值来判断「高不高」。这个阈值不是拍出来的，它来自<strong>保障对转化率的增益</strong>：如果保障带来的增量毛利大于它的单位成本，它就值得提供。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>阈值</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>增量转化率</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>单均毛利</mtext><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>新增退货成本率</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{阈值} = \\text{增量转化率} \\times \\text{单均毛利} \\times (1 - \\text{新增退货成本率})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">阈值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">增量转化率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单均毛利</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">新增退货成本率</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第三项来自第三章的一个结论：保障在提高转化的同时也可能提高退货率，因此增量毛利必须扣掉新增退货的成本。若某产品的单位成本超过了这个阈值，理性的选择是收缩它的承诺范围（缩窗口、降上限、限品类）而不是取消它——取消会损失全部的转化增益。</p>\n<h3 id=\"阈值随品类变化\">阈值随品类变化</h3><p>同一个单位成本，在不同品类上是否「超标」的结论可能完全不同。高毛利品类的阈值高，能容忍更贵的保障；低毛利标准品类的阈值低，只适合最便宜的保障形式。这解释了为什么实践中保障产品总是按品类分层：<strong>不是所有商品都值得同样的保障，因为它们的转化增益不同</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>品类特征</th>\n<th>单均毛利</th>\n<th>可容忍单位成本</th>\n<th>适合的保障形式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高毛利、高不确定性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>全额正品保障 + 退货保障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高毛利、低不确定性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>延迟赔付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低毛利、高退货率</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>只做运费险（买家自付保费）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低毛利、低退货率</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>平台基础承诺，不加额外保障</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与准备金模型的接口\">与准备金模型的接口</h2><p>本篇的单位成本与第二章的准备金模型是同一份数据的两个视角，它们必须来自同一个数据源以避免口径分裂。成本模型用的是<strong>期望值</strong>，准备金模型用的是<strong>波动与占用</strong>；前者决定产品是否值得做，后者决定需要备多少现金。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>视角</th>\n<th>使用量</th>\n<th>决策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成本模型</td>\n<td>期望净赔付、单位成本</td>\n<td>是否继续提供该保障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>准备金模型</td>\n<td>赔付波动、资金占用</td>\n<td>池子要备多大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个常见的组织问题是这两个视角由不同团队维护，导致成本报表与资金报表对不上。工程上的对策是让<strong>赔付流水成为唯一真相源</strong>，两侧的报表都由它派生，差异只应来自聚合口径而不应来自原始数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>赔付率有三种定义，<strong>保险型用保费、平台型用 GMV、单位经济型用订单数</strong>，混用会得出相反结论。</li>\n<li>价保在财务上是<strong>营销支出而非保险</strong>，应放进获客成本口径核算。</li>\n<li>单位成本必须包含五项：赔付、追偿扣减、运营、欺诈损失、准备金占用。</li>\n<li>追偿回收额必须扣减，且要同时报告毛额、回收额与回收率。</li>\n<li>期望赔付应按<strong>违约类型分解</strong>，避免不同违约类型的变化互相抵消。</li>\n<li>单位成本阈值来自<strong>保障带来的增量毛利</strong>，且必须扣掉新增退货成本；阈值随品类变化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>成本算清之后，谁该为此付钱见 <a href=\"guarantee-merchant-chargeback\">保障成本向商家分摊/扣款</a>；不该发生的赔付如何被识别与压制见 <a href=\"guarantee-fraud-abuse\">保障滥用与欺诈防控</a>。资金池的规模与超赔处置见 <a href=\"../platform-advance-payout/guarantee-fund-reserve\">保障资金池与准备金</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"赔付率与保障成本模型","id":"赔付率与保障成本模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：赔付率的三种定义","id":"核心概念-赔付率的三种定义"},{"level":2,"text":"成本的完整构成","id":"成本的完整构成"},{"level":3,"text":"追偿回收额为什么必须扣减","id":"追偿回收额为什么必须扣减"},{"level":2,"text":"期望赔付额的计算","id":"期望赔付额的计算"},{"level":2,"text":"单位经济阈值怎么定","id":"单位经济阈值怎么定"},{"level":3,"text":"阈值随品类变化","id":"阈值随品类变化"},{"level":2,"text":"与准备金模型的接口","id":"与准备金模型的接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"保障信任信号在购买链路展示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/consumer-guarantee-promise-platform/promise-fulfillment-monitor/guarantee-trust-signal-ui"},"next":{"title":"保障成本向商家分摊/扣款","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/consumer-guarantee-promise-platform/guarantee-cost-ops/guarantee-merchant-chargeback"}}